## The release's VM arguments (mix release copies this file into the release).
##
## Crash dumps are off: a BEAM crash dump holds every process's heap, run token
## and OIDC request token included. Packaging (plan Task 27) must check that
## the Burrito launcher passes this file to erlexec, or set
## ERL_CRASH_DUMP_SECONDS=0 in the environment before the VM starts.
-env ERL_CRASH_DUMP_SECONDS 0
